{"task_id": "HumanEval/13", "solution": "def greatest_common_divisor(a: int, b: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return a greatest common divisor of two integers a and b.\n    This uses the Euclidean algorithm, handling absolute values and zero inputs.\"\"\"\n    a = abs(a)\n    b = abs(b)\n\n    if a == 0:\n        return b\n    if b == 0:\n        return a\n\n    while b:\n        a, b = b, a % b\n    return a"}
