{"task_id": "HumanEval/36", "solution": "def fizz_buzz(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return the count of digit 7 in numbers less than n, divisible by 11 or 13.\n    This function processes integers from 1 up to n-1.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _count_digit(number: int, digit: int) -> int:\n        # Helper function to count digit occurrences in a number.\n        return str(number).count(str(digit))\n\n    def _is_divisible_by_11_or_13(num: int) -> bool:\n        # Helper function to check if a number is divisible by 11 or 13.\n        return (num % 11 == 0) or (num % 13 == 0)\n\n    total_sevens = 0\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        if _is_divisible_by_11_or_13(i):\n            total_sevens += _count_digit(i, 7)\n\n    return total_sevens"}
