{"task_id": "HumanEval/46", "solution": "def fib4(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n-th term of the Fib4 sequence iteratively.\n    The sequence is defined by fib4(n) = fib4(n-1) + fib4(n-2) + fib4(n-3) + fib4(n-4) with given base cases.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 2:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 3:\n        return 0\n    else:\n        # Initialize the last four values: fib4(0), fib4(1), fib4(2), fib4(3)\n        a, b, c, d = 0, 0, 2, 0\n\n        for _ in range(4, n + 1):\n            next_fib = a + b + c + d\n            a, b, c, d = b, c, d, next_fib\n        return d"}
